{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38138","headline":"曲江夜思 · 韩偓","name":"曲江夜思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼓声将绝月斜痕，园外闲坊半掩门。\n池里红莲凝白露，苑中青草伴黄昏。\n林塘阒寂偏宜夜，烟火稀疎便似村。\n大抵世间幽独景，最关诗思与离魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}